<title>USA: Enron Q1 power sales half 1996 total.</title>
<headline>Enron Q1 power sales half 1996 total.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enron Corp has already achieved half its total 1996 power sales in the first quarter of 1997, chief executive Kenneth Lay said Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Our power marketing division has had sales of 30 million megawatts of electricity, he told the Howard Weil Energy Conference.</p>
<p>By the second or third quarter of this year, Enron will overtake Southern Co as the largest overall seller of electricity in the U.S., Lay said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
